This test only verifies that TagsCommand overrides the default GitHub release lookup.
The intentionally minimal AppImage config is not a complete ebuild fixture.

-- test-options.json --
{}
-- input.config --
Type Github AppImage Release
GithubProjectUrl https://github.com/janhq/jan/
TagsCommand cat tags.txt
DesktopFile jan
Category app-misc
EbuildName jan-appimage
ProgramName jan

-- expected.yaml --
          tags=$(cat tags.txt)
